<body data-time="all">
  <header class="site"><div class="wrap bar"><a class="brand" href="/">Vault <b>Human</b></a><nav class="navlinks" id="navlinks"><a href="/method/">The approach</a><div class="navdrop"><button class="navdrop__btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true">Your life <span aria-hidden="true">▾</span></button><div class="navdrop__menu"><a href="/as-learned/">Learning your past</a><a href="/as-loved/">Loving your present</a><a href="/as-lived/">Living your future</a></div></div><a href="/speaking/">About Russ</a><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Begin</a></nav><button class="navtoggle" type="button" aria-label="Open menu" aria-controls="navlinks" aria-expanded="false"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button></div></header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero"><div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">The 360 · keys for the mind</p>
      <h1>Three hundred sixty keys. <em>Each in its place.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">We distilled 360 of the best ideas people have found for living well, from ancient practice to modern psychology, and placed each one in the part of your life where it helps most. You don't study them. Your coach turns each one into a two-minute lesson and one thing to do, and walks you through it.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Begin with Vault</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#chambers">See the chambers</a></div>
    </div></section>
    <section class="sec" style="padding-top:20px"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="ck-steps">
        <div><span>01</span><b>It arrives</b><p>A two-minute lesson from your coach each morning, from the chamber you're in.</p></div>
        <div><span>02</span><b>You use it</b><p>One thing to do today: a practice, a call, a conversation, a walk.</p></div>
        <div><span>03</span><b>You log it</b><p>One line: what you did and what it did.</p></div>
        <div><span>04</span><b>It turns</b><p>When it becomes a habit, the key turns and the gate swings open.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div></section>
    <section class="sec" style="padding-top:20px"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">The coaching year</p><h2>Eleven chambers. Nine gates.</h2><p class="lede">Read it like a clock from the top. Each slice is a chamber, one part of your life. Each gate opens with keys: when the month's practice becomes a habit, you move through. After Healing, a pause to integrate.</p></div>
      <div class="wheelbox"><svg class="wheel" viewBox="0 0 500 500" role="img" aria-label="The Vault Human year as a wheel: eleven chambers and a pause for integration after the fifth, with nine gates, each opened by keys."><path d="M252.1 54.0 A196 196 0 0 1 346.2 79.2 L301.1 159.4 A104 104 0 0 0 251.1 146.0Z" fill="var(--w-self)"/><text class="wn" x="291.4" y="91.5">You</text><text class="wv" x="291.4" y="105.5">by Being</text><text class="wm" x="280.5" y="139.0">1</text><path d="M349.8 81.3 A196 196 0 0 1 418.7 150.2 L339.5 197.1 A104 104 0 0 0 302.9 160.5Z" fill="var(--w-self)"/><text class="wn" x="363.1" y="132.9">Body</text><text class="wv" x="363.1" y="146.9">by Breathing</text><text class="wm" x="333.4" y="169.6">2</text><line class="wg" x1="302.0" y1="159.9" x2="348.0" y2="80.3"/><g transform="translate(360.0 59.5)"><rect x="-19" y="-12" width="38" height="24" rx="12" class="gbg"/><path d="M-13 6V-4M-4 6V-4M-13-4Q-8.5-8.5-4-4" class="gi"/><path d="M-4 5.5L-8 3.5V-3.5" class="gi gleaf"/><circle cx="4.5" cy="0" r="3.4" class="gi gk"/><path d="M7.9 0H15M12 0V3.2M15 0V3.2" class="gi gkey"/></g><path d="M420.8 153.8 A196 196 0 0 1 446.0 247.9 L354.0 248.9 A104 104 0 0 0 340.6 198.9Z" fill="var(--w-self)"/><text class="wn" x="404.5" y="204.6">Awareness</text><text class="wv" x="404.5" y="218.6">by Attending</text><text class="wm" x="364.0" y="222.5">3</text><line class="wg" x1="340.1" y1="198.0" x2="419.7" y2="152.0"/><g transform="translate(440.5 140.0)"><rect x="-19" y="-12" width="38" height="24" rx="12" class="gbg"/><path d="M-13 6V-4M-4 6V-4M-13-4Q-8.5-8.5-4-4" class="gi"/><path d="M-4 5.5L-8 3.5V-3.5" class="gi gleaf"/><circle cx="4.5" cy="0" r="3.4" class="gi gk"/><path d="M7.9 0H15M12 0V3.2M15 0V3.2" class="gi gkey"/></g><path d="M446.0 252.1 A196 196 0 0 1 420.8 346.2 L340.6 301.1 A104 104 0 0 0 354.0 251.1Z" fill="var(--w-self)"/><text class="wn" x="404.5" y="287.4">Meaning</text><text class="wv" x="404.5" y="301.4">by Making</text><text class="wm" x="